<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tadiran downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tadiran downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers downgraded Israel's Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd to outperform from strong buy, a spokesman for the firm said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Lehman cited the stock's valuation and set a target price of $28 a share.</p>
<p>-- The stock opened down one at 24-7/8.</p>
<p>--Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
